FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (FRD)

1. Purpose
Define the functional requirements needed to support the transportation optimization solution.

2. Functional Requirements

FR-001: Analyze demand by pickup location and time.
FR-002: Calculate vehicle occupancy and utilization.
FR-003: Identify overcrowded and underutilized trips.
FR-004: Calculate employee waiting time.
FR-005: Calculate delays and On-Time Performance.
FR-006: Analyze cancellation count, rate and reasons.
FR-007: Compare route and vehicle performance.
FR-008: Calculate transportation cost per trip.
FR-009: Monitor vendor performance.
FR-010: Provide dashboard filters for date, route, location, vehicle and vendor.

3. KPI Formulas

Vehicle Utilization % =
Booked Seats / Vehicle Capacity × 100

Waiting Time =
Actual Pickup Time − Scheduled Pickup Time

OTP % =
On-Time Trips / Completed Trips × 100

Cancellation Rate =
Cancelled Trips / Scheduled Trips × 100

Cost per Trip =
Total Trip Cost / Completed Trips

4. Non-Functional Requirements

• Easy-to-use dashboard
• Good data quality
• Consistent KPI definitions
• Easy to update
• Efficient dashboard performance
• Protect unnecessary employee information

5. Tools

Excel | SQL | Power BI | Jira | Lucidchart / Draw.io
